#: ../../source/features.rst:140
msgid ""
"PartCAD is capable of using generative AI to create parts. The generated "
"part definitions are persisted as Python or CAD scripts."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD es capaz de usar IA generativa para crear piezas. Las "
"definiciones de pieza generadas se guardan como scripts de Python o "
"CAD."

#: ../../source/features.rst:152
msgid ""
"To use ChatGPT instead of Gemini, pass \"openai\" instead of \"google\" "
